        "5E3000000000001C"
      ],
      "description": [
        "Mill coke in a Create Millstone to get coke dust without a macerator. Use the MI Forge Hammer for iron dust, combine seven iron dust with two coke dust, then smelt uncooked steel dust in the Steam Blast Furnace. Follow the native MI construction guide for its complete multiblock.",
        "The next Revo drill stays Create-powered, but adds real water cooling and maintenance. Keep the Iron Drill working while building the upgrade."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E40000000001010",
          "type": "item",
          "item": {
            "id": "modern_industrialization:steel_ingot",
            "count": 1
