      "description": [
        "Steel extraction now adds raw lead and antimony for the first LV batteries, Mineral Sludge for quartz, and Gem Sludge for diamonds/lapis/emeralds.",
        "Process sludge with water-backed Create Encased Fans. The drill no longer drops loose diamonds or lapis. Keep existing steam ore processing running."
